; XAUUSD_M1_LiquidityZeroCross_Bearish_FGF v1.10 - same as XLZC_Bearish_M3_H1_NY plus the FlashGold Direction Filter v1.2 (indicator default inputs).
; Base-EA figures without the filter: In-sample backtest (all 17 months used for selection): 77 trades, PF 2.48; per period 2.15 / 2.80 / 2.56. Same-bar trailing worst case PF 1.82.
; Walk-forward: picking on 2025 only, the top-10 configs had median 2026 PF 0.67; the best 2025 pair family (M2/H1) had median 2026 PF 1.27. Base rate: 51% of all configs were profitable in 2026. This exact setup ranked 91 of 86241 on 2025 alone and made PF 2.56 on 30 trades in 2026: the M2/M3-trigger + H1-bias family held up out of sample, the exact parameter values are not proven.
; Session hours are BROKER SERVER TIME (TradingHoursAreGMT=false). They were calibrated on FTMO data whose clock is GMT+2 winter / GMT+3 summer (New York close).
; UseNewsFilter=true was NOT part of the backtest (no calendar history); live trade count and results will differ. Set it to false to match the backtest exactly.
; FlashGold defaults on this setup (in-sample): 28 trades, PF 3.18, net +8.7R vs 77 trades, PF 2.48, net +20.8R without the filter: higher PF, about a third of the trades, less total profit.
